  { number := 296, text := "Records hierarchical subagents as numbered specification 0016 with file name `0016_Hierarchical_Subagents.md`. The version line is 0.1.0 dated 20261026. No earlier shipped version of this specification is claimed. Records the layers `L0`, `L1`, `L2`, and `L3`, with no `L4`, and that an attached client is not a layer. Records a fast path of four acts, reports under `~/.agents/reports/` on the host with the four parts in Clause 4.7, the plan gate, parallel coordinators without a numeric cap, one long job at nice 19, informative sampling figures, finished work checked against files on disk, red then green where a change is a behavior change, and process repair when an instruction is repeated. Records that an `L2` token total is at least the sum of its `L3` token totals, and that an `L2` that exits without a report is not finished. Records the capture of [issue 224](https://github.com/SurmountSystems/grok-oss/issues/224). Records that a conforming hierarchical subagent program is not claimed. No new shipped version is claimed for that capture." },
